From 1dab0b0778a5625b80e7cf1d74e070ff3178387e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Cooper <alextcooper@openacai.com>
Date: Thu, 4 Jun 2026 08:53:52 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 02/13] Modernize IL2CPP runtime hosting for OpenACAI

Carry the .NET 10 IL2CPP hosting path forward with hostfxr initialization parameters, preload search path setup, native detour compatibility tweaks, and startup diagnostics. Brand the BepInEx console window and startup log as OpenACAI Loader while preserving BepInEx runtime credit.
---
 BepInEx.Core/Bootstrap/BaseChainloader.cs     |  2 +-
 .../Logging/ChainloaderLogHelper.cs           |  3 +-
 .../RuntimeFixes/ConsoleSetOutFix.cs          |  6 ++-
 .../BepInEx.Unity.Common.csproj               |  2 +
 .../BepInEx.Unity.IL2CPP.csproj               |  4 +-
 .../DoorstopEntrypoint.cs                     | 30 ++++++++++++-
 .../Hook/BaseNativeDetour.cs                  |  6 +--
 .../Unity/BepInEx.Unity.IL2CPP/Preloader.cs   | 42 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../UnityPreloadRunner.cs                     | 29 +++++++++++++
 9 files changed, 115 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

